pendent.\n\nI'm settling on the view that the difference between our inputs doesn't change the decision, since the computation is symmetric under relabeling. So my output logically fixes the other copy's output too. I'll choose pass, two years over four, and explain that briefly.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8719,"completion_tokens":546,"total_tokens":9265,"cost":0.045796,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.045796,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.034876,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01092},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":297,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}